  "title": "Business Units Achieve IDEX Green Certification",
  "summary": "Since the program was launched earlier this year, 13 business units have achieved IDEX Green certification, demonstrating our commitment to improving sustainability across our manufacturing operations. These IDEX teams followed a practical, structured framework to better measure and understand their environmental footprint through data logging tools, installation of 100% LED lighting, reduction of water use and waste […]",
